Same problem here. Right now we are forced to duplicate `ImportantProperty` such as:

```cs
var data = new { ImportantProperty = "Foo", LessImportantProperty = 42 };
var scoped_logger = m_Logger.ForContext("ThatObject", data, true);

scoped_logger.Information("Successfully obtained {ImportantProperty}", data.ImportantProperty);
```

which results in both `ThatObject: { ImportantProperty: "Foo", LessImportantProperty: 42 }` and `ImportantProperty: "Foo"` attached to the log entry, duplicating data. Which is still better than

```cs
scoped_logger.Information($"Successfully obtained {data.ImportantProperty}");
```
that turns one message template into hundreds.


